# Large intermediates, regenerable and not needed to run the site.
#
# raw_spans.json in particular is a machine-readable transcription of the
# source book's appendix table -- the derived calendar (nasi_days.json) is
# what this project publishes, with attribution. Regenerate it locally with
# scripts/extract_spans.py against your own copy of the PDF.
data/raw_spans.json
data/label_tokens.json

# NASA's catalog is public domain but 1.4MB and trivially re-fetched:
#   curl -o data/nasa_5MKLE_catalog.txt https://eclipse.gsfc.nasa.gov/5MCLE/5MKLEcatalog.txt
data/nasa_5MKLE_catalog.txt

__pycache__/
*.pyc
